  "Chapter": "再次，被魔法所俘——",
  "Title": "内心的焦躁仍未消散",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 2006301001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "周围所有人，都是敌人。/n既然我是World Dai Star的女儿，就绝不允许失败。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1050",
      "BgmFileName": "9",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那时候的我，就是这么想的。/n我伤害了克里斯，也伤害了很多人。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "然后……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "玻璃碎裂的声音、脑中一片空白而说不出下一句台词。/n冰冷的汗水流过身体，甚至连滴落到地板上的声音都留在脑海里。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "灰姑娘没能在舞台上绽放任何美丽，/n只是难看地僵在了那里。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "明明我伤害了那么多人，/n明明还说过“我没法和你们一起演”那种话。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可我却……毁了舞台。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "来到日本、遇到心菜之后，/n我自己也觉得成长了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006301009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006301,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可是，那一天的事我绝对忘不了。/n……也不能忘。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20063010090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
